{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Before You Buy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game alternates between combat stages and narrative segments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story sections use different visual styles to reflect the character\u2019s inner journey through different stages of life, so the visual style may shift between segments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by a single creator. A tight, cohesive experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat Mechanics / Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The core combat is built around Super Armor Break.</strong><br>Precise parries, well-timed dodges, and dealing damage all build energy, which can be unleashed at the right moment to interrupt enemy attacks and gradually take control of the fight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers multiple offensive options, including high-risk techniques that deliver equally high rewards when used with proper judgment and execution, resulting in impactful and satisfying combat encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833600/extras/a404149de33f3ee0d761bc929a55ac2a.poster.avif?t=1773083436\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833600/extras/a404149de33f3ee0d761bc929a55ac2a.webm?t=1773083436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833600/extras/a404149de33f3ee0d761bc929a55ac2a.mp4?t=1773083436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833600/extras/4c5cb987a4f10aae3132de5c52c4ad20.poster.avif?t=1773083436\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833600/extras/4c5cb987a4f10aae3132de5c52c4ad20.webm?t=1773083436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833600/extras/4c5cb987a4f10aae3132de5c52c4ad20.mp4?t=1773083436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Narrative</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game follows a <strong>linear narrative structure</strong>, with the journey unfolding along a fixed timeline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players move through several distinct yet interconnected stages, transitioning from light, pure moments to increasingly complex and oppressive confrontations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Changes in environments, characters, and gameplay form an allegorical journey of growth and transformation.<br>Certain meanings are never stated outright, and are instead left for players to interpret through their own experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833600/extras/f926cbd9d2e36915679710993cc3a1a6.avif?t=1773083436\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833600/extras_big/f926cbd9d2e36915679710993cc3a1a6.webp?t=1773083436 width=1560 height=877 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833600/extras/48febcdc704668d1a4b0eaa462ae189b.avif?t=1773083436\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833600/extras_big/48febcdc704668d1a4b0eaa462ae189b.avif?t=1773083436 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Hero in My Heart","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3833600/bc83a56e97f008d81b29a9a9f59b9d8d908b6417.jpg"}